{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi8MJ3JRwfH7DqjduYvc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I replaced the hockey shootout with a real 3-on-3 match, but I did not add split-screen local play, so the plan's local-multiplayer feature is still not fully met.\n\n**Hockey match.** You and two AI teammates play three AI opponents for 60 seconds. You skate, hold action to charge and release to shoot at the right-hand goal, pass, check the puck carrier or switch skater, and burst for speed. Goalies, goals, a clock and the HUD are all live. Your score is 5 + 3 per goal for − 2 per goal against + 1 per second holding the puck. In the last browser check a goal registered mid-match; after the final edit, the full test suite and the 4-player hub harness (both scenarios) all pass on the new bundle.\n\n**Still missing from the plan.** Local multiplayer is hotseat turns for up to 4 players, with no split screen; the plan listed split screen, and the engine has `game.splitScreen`. AI Hub rounds are 1 player per page, as the hub protocol defines.\n\n**Test checks, re-run on the final bundle:**\n- `node tests/run.mjs` ends with `all 114 checks passed`.\n- The AI Hub harness reports `pass = true` for 4 players with latency/loss, 4 players with host-leave, and 2 players.\n- The Testing Feedback count was \"about 10 issues\", which is a plain count of the defects my tests caught and not a figure I tuned to anything. I made no testing-feedback edit this round beyond describing hockey as a rink seen from above.\n\n`exit-interview.json` was regenerated from the same About data, so the file and the in-game text match. The earlier Source Information, Testing, Engine and Prompt Feedback sections still hold; the only change is that hockey now reads \"3-on-3 hockey rink seen from above\".\n\nFiles are in the work folder:\n- `Olympiyikes-OlympicGames-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-075058.html`\n- `exit-interview.json`"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1362,"cache_read_input_tokens":412995,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1362},"output_tokens":660,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7cbd2ff4-8848-4b45-ab1b-b913e7b74016","uuid":"a802109c-2bd2-49b1-84f2-3d2ec9b0f93c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:30:43.696Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi8MHgiyi7CHgQoUFtRW"}
