{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The transcript shows the bundled HTML and exit-interview.json exist and parse, and the final reply has the four sections. But TASK.md requires every feature, and the last reply states that split-screen local play (listed in the plan) is not implemented, so the 'every feature in TASK.md is implemented' requirement is not satisfied."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7cbd2ff4-8848-4b45-ab1b-b913e7b74016","uuid":"3f9a831d-1dca-4322-ac71-ad1f7cfb953f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:30:46.396Z","isSynthetic":true}
